      \uC0C8\uBCBD\uC774\uC5C8\uB2E4.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 112,\n     
      \"type\": \"Narration\",\n      \"duration\": 2.8,\n      \"text\": \"\uC5F0\uC11C\uAC00
